Third-party licenses and attributions for hermes-jarvis-voice
==============================================================

The 2026-07-28 Command Centre redesign removed the previously ported
three.js orb visualizer (and the `three` dependency with it). The current
intelligence-core renderer (ui/src/visualizer/core.js) is a first-party 2D
canvas implementation ported from this project's own design prototype
(design/"Jarvis Command Centre.dc.html") and carries no third-party code.

Historical note: earlier builds bundled three.js (MIT, © 2010-2026 three.js
authors) and ported orb/particle code from jincocodev/openclaw-jarvis-ui
(ISC, © 2026 JincocoDev; itself based on Filip Zrnzevic's Three.js Orb
Visualizer). None of that code remains in the source tree or the shipped
bundle.

